+### limitedFunction.activeCount
+
+The number of calls that are currently running.
+
+### limitedFunction.pendingCount
+
+The number of calls that are waiting to run.
+
+### limitedFunction.concurrency
+
+Get or set the concurrency limit for the limited function.
+
